## Models Package Overview
Database access layer and repository pattern implementation for go-skeleton.

## Repository Pattern
- Interface-based repositories
- Centralized connection management
- Connection pooling
- Health monitoring

## Key Features
- Type-safe data access
- Dependency injection
- Thread-safe concurrent access
- Proper error handling

## Important Notes
When modifying model code:
1. Update test files
2. Follow repository pattern
3. Add connection error handling
4. Document schema changes
